 "title": "Gene and Protein Annotation and Orthology Research Network",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the research and annotation of genes and proteins, particularly in the context of orthology. Key entities include OrthoDB, a database of orthologs, and UniProt, a comprehensive protein database. Other entities, such as Gene Ontology, KEGG, and BUSCO, contribute to the annotation and analysis of genes and proteins. The cluster also highlights collaborations and publications, including a paper published in Nucleic Acids Res by Evgeny M Zdobnov and a paper on orthologs by Koonin E.V. The network showcases the use of various tools and methods, including AlphaFold, DeepMind, and BLAST, in the annotation and analysis of genes and proteins.",
